    {
      "name": "走·踩空",
      "chapter": "1-3",
      "precondition_names": [],
      "condition": {
        "operator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "key": "节内计数",
            "comparator": ">=",
            "value": 3
          },
          {
            "key": "破坏性",
            "comparator": ">=",
            "value": 2.3
          }
        ]
      },
      "repeatable": false,
      "action_type": "insert",
      "action_data": {
        "type": "insert",
        "text_type": "interaction",
        "highlight": false,
        "delayed": false,
        "text": "第二步落下去，脚底没有顶住东西。不是软，是空——像踩进一个刚好装得下脚的坑。\n我停在那儿，没有往下压。过了很久，坑底下才传来一点动静，很密，很轻，像一把沙子在筛。"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "走·先看",
      "chapter": "1-3",
      "precondition_names": [],
      "condition": {
        "operator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "key": "节内计数",
            "comparator": ">=",
            "value": 3
          },
          {
            "key": "破坏性",
            "comparator": "<",
            "value": 2.3
          }
        ]
      },
      "repeatable": false,
      "action_type": "insert",
      "action_data": {
        "type": "insert",
        "text_type": "interaction",
        "highlight": false,
        "delayed": false,
        "text": "我现在落脚之前会先看。\n有一次，一条路上排着一长串车。我把脚抬起来，抬了很久，久到膝盖开始发酸，等那一串全部走完，才落下去。落下去的地方是空的，路面上只有几道压出来的白印。"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "走·记住一张脸",
      "chapter": "1-3",
      "precondition_names": [],
      "condition": {
        "operator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "key": "节内计数",
            "comparator": ">=",
            "value": 6
          },
          {
            "key": "介入度",
            "comparator": ">=",
            "value": 2.3
          }
        ]
      },
      "repeatable": false,
      "action_type": "insert",
      "action_data": {
        "type": "insert",
        "text_type": "branch",
        "highlight": false,
        "delayed": false,
        "text": "我试着记住一张脸。田埂上有一个人仰着头，抱着一捆东西，嘴一直张着，喊的是同一句话。我盯着他看，看到他把嘴闭上，把东西放下，转身走了。\n我记住了他走路的姿势：左脚往外撇。"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "走·人和天气",
      "chapter": "1-3",
      "precondition_names": [],
      "condition": {
        "operator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "key": "节内计数",
            "comparator": ">=",
            "value": 6
          },
          {
            "key": "介入度",
            "comparator": "<",
            "value": 2.3
          }
        ]
      },
      "repeatable": false,
      "action_type": "insert",
      "action_data": {
        "type": "insert",
        "text_type": "branch",
        "highlight": false,
        "delayed": false,
        "text": "看得久了，人也变成一种天气。\n跑的人是风，站着不动的人是石头，挥手的人是雨——落一阵就停。我开始按这个来躲：躲风，绕开石头，不理雨。"
      }
    },
